</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lives again our glorious King,</l><l>Hallelujah!</l><l>Where, O Death, is now thy sting?</l><l>Hallelujah!</l><l>Dying once He all doth save,</l><l>Hallelujah!</l><l>Where thy victory, O grave?</l><l>Hallelujah!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Love’s redeeming work is done,</l><l>Hallelujah!</l><l>Fought the fight, the battle won,</l><l>Hallelujah!</l><l>Death in vain forbade Him rise,</l><l>Hallelujah!</l><l>Christ ascended o’er the skies,</l><l>Hallelujah!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Soar we now where Christ hath led,</l><l>Hallelujah!</l><l>Following our exalted Head,</l><l>Hallelujah!</l><l>Made like Him, like Him we rise,</l><l>Hallelujah!</l><l>Free from all the earthly ties,</l><l>Hallelujah!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
